{
  "readme": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac547fc5-8c8c-4f86-b62e-ef61ff8d2bce\" alt=\"HyperOS Theme Manager Mod\" width=\"100%\"/>\n\n# HyperOS Theme Manager Mod\n\n**Unlocks full theme customisation in HyperOS.**\n\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager?style=for-the-badge&label=release&color=0a84ff)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager/releases/latest)\n[![Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager/total?style=for-the-badge&color=30d158)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager/releases)\n[![Stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager?style=for-the-badge&color=ffd60a)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager/stargazers)\n[![Telegram](https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-channel-26A5E4?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white)](https://t.me/kashis_cringey_stuffs)\n\n</div>\n\n## Features\n- Choose from multiple theme servers\n- Premium themes\n- AI wallpapers\n- Import third-party themes\n- Super icons and super widgets\n- High-end features unlocked on low-end devices\n\n## Requirements\n- HyperOS\n- Magisk, KernelSU or APatch\n- [HyperOS App Vault Mod](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-App-Vault), needed for premium widgets\n\n## Installation\n1. Download the latest zip from [**Releases**](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager/releases/latest).\n2. Flash it in Magisk, KernelSU or APatch.\n3. Reboot your device.\n\n## Notes\n- Stock ROMs: flash [Apk Protection Patch](https://github.com/Mods-Center/Apk-Protection-Patch) first.\n\n## Screenshots\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e05555b-5aee-43ef-a586-6fe97921b887\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c39968ec-0b1c-42aa-90b0-f739e09d17d6\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8fff491-73f8-48db-8dee-5db79333e054\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8efafb39-868b-48de-8b35-b939da1b19b3\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Theme Manager\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b81b252-29ce-4ecc-86d0-9e6293849b21\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3fdf845b-a8c9-4df4-87ef-d25a46e0bead\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33f5a7a9-ad77-4d65-a47b-6b34df740880\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Theme Manager\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4ede230-5fbc-481c-a74c-9aadeead30ab\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Theme Manager\"/>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\nMade by **[🅺🅰🆂🅷🅸](https://t.me/kakashi1v1)** · part of **[Mods Center](https://github.com/Mods-Center)**\n\n[Website](https://modscenter.org) · [Channel](https://t.me/kashis_cringey_stuffs) · [Support group](https://t.me/bootloop_discussion) · [Report a bug](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Theme-Manager/issues)\n\n</div>\n",
